1033..1111 Comment "/// Rotating by `b` and back is the identity (cubical\'s `rotInv-1`, `b · a ·"
1112..1192 Comment "/// invLooper b ≡ a`, `_·_` associating to the left). The obligation over `a`"
1193..1267 Comment "/// holds `b` at its point, where `mul(Base, a)` is `a` and the loop moves"
1268..1340 Comment "/// through `mul`\'s second argument as itself; the one over `b` moves it"
1341..1416 Comment "/// through both of the outer `mul`\'s arguments, the loop then its inverse."
